cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you utilize BIOTrace in your research, software, or benchmarks, please cite it as below."
title: "BIOTrace: Biological Intelligence & Multimodal Media Authenticity"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mummana"
    given-names: "Sravya"
    affiliation: "BIOTrace Research"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SravyaMummana2006/BioTrace"
url: "https://github.com/SravyaMummana2006/BioTrace"
keywords:
  - "deepfake detection"
  - "multimodal fusion"
  - "rPPG"
  - "remote photoplethysmography"
  - "facial kinematics"
  - "media forensics"
  - "efficientnet"
  - "bipartite actor isolation"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  BIOTrace is an open-source biological intelligence and multimodal media authenticity
  platform. It integrates convolutional visual feature extraction (EfficientNet-B0) with
  subcutaneous remote photoplethysmography (rPPG CHROM/POS) and facial kinematic dynamics
  (Eye Aspect Ratio velocity, opening dynamics, and bilateral blink asymmetry) to detect
  synthetic and manipulated facial media under rigorous bipartite actor-isolated evaluation.
